  Description: "COMPANION / RARE / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nON RECRUIT / ALTAR CREATION:
    gain 100 gold immediately once. No recurring payment just for keeping this ally.\r\n\nSUPPORT
    WHILE OWNED\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support
    sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA drafter whose city builds from folded
    plans. Their first shelter trapped residents when the plan refused revisions.
    They now test every design with someone allowed to say it does not fit.\r\nPERSONAL
    PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies
    and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level
    unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nSource:
    dream shop or special reward, subject to hero theme and unlock wave.\r\nBonds:
    orchard, resolve. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star
    bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
